"Yesterday evening, it rained suddenly," Sara says.
Yes, there was good rain yesterday.
Then we talk about last week's game.
Last week Kiran lost the game.
Sara remembers that and laughs.
Kiran also hears that and laughs.
Suddenly Sara asks me something.
"Maya, when did you come to Kochi?" she asks.
I look at Sara and smile.
I came here in January.
Time went very fast.
I tell them about my first days in Kochi.
